#: levels/seraph/seraph.gd:12
msgid "Retrieve the SERAPH-7 data core from the Lab C server."
msgstr "Recupera il nucleo dati SERAPH-7 dal server del Laboratorio C."

#: levels/seraph/seraph.gd:13
